Publication packaging and BANKING77-specific inference loader: Cahol, 2026.

This release is derived from Laya by Nandha Kishor M / Convai Innovations.
Upstream code: https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya
Code revision: 42626c348753fbb17572a813127df2278a1ec527
Base model: https://huggingface.co/convaiinnovations/laya
