The original laya/common.py is included unchanged as laya_common.py.
The upstream Apache License 2.0 is included as LICENSE.

Changes: supervised BANKING77 adaptation of encoder LoRA, decision transformer,
type embeddings and option scorer; separate temperature calibration; custom
input encoding that preserves all 77 options; standalone checkpoint loader.
The upstream act/escalate head was not fine-tuned and is not exposed by this loader.

BANKING77 dataset: PolyAI; Casanueva et al. (2020).
Dataset attribution and CC BY 4.0 license are described in DATA_LICENSE.md.
